1. NASA data (in data/)
   - data/ephem/*/<year>.json, landing.json, data/ephem/_scene/*.json and the
     daily summaries derived from them: Sun and Earth directions and
     distances from NASA JPL Horizons (Solar System Dynamics, Jet Propulsion
     Laboratory). https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/horizons/
   - data/ephem/*/horizon.json: terrain horizons computed from NASA LRO
     Lunar Orbiter Laser Altimeter (LOLA) GDR elevation maps, PDS
     Geosciences Node. https://pds-geosciences.wustl.edu/missions/lro/lola.htm
     (The raw maps are not stored in this repository.)
   - data/checks/: values queried from NASA JPL Horizons.
   - Site coordinates and landing times in data/sites.js are facts taken
     from the sources listed for each site (NASA NSSDCA, LROC / Arizona
     State University, ISRO, NASA).

